  "description": "<p>Rothco's Thin Blue Line &amp; Thin Red Line T-Shirt offers a meaningful way to show respect and support for both law enforcement officers and firefighters. Featuring the iconic US Flag with both the Thin Blue Line and Thin Red Line, this t-shirt symbolizes the commitment, bravery, and sacrifice of police officers, firefighters, and first responders. Made from a soft and comfortable cotton / polyester fabric blend, this short sleeve shirt is perfect for everyday wear. The tag-less label ensures added comfort, making it ideal for long-lasting use. Whether you&rsquo;re attending a community event or simply going about your day, this graphic t-shirt proudly displays your appreciation for those who protect and serve. A portion of the proceeds from this shirt also benefits families of fallen first responders.</p>",
